# Repo infrastructure - only admins can modify
/.github/                @awslabs/startups-admins
# Enforcement code for /.github/, so it needs the same review as what it enforces.
# `tools/reviewer-guard/` holds the allowlist that permits `agentcore-reviewer.yml` to run
# on `pull_request_target`. Adding an entry to ALLOWED_USES, adding a shell hash, or making
# main() return 0 is exactly as powerful as editing the workflow itself. The guard lives
# outside `.github/workflows/` because the hostile fixtures beside it were being read as
# real pipelines by every workflow scanner in CI, and without this rule that move would
# have traded a scanner problem for a missing-review problem. There is no `*` default
# owner, so an unmatched path needs nobody.
/tools/                  @awslabs/startups-admins
mise.toml                @awslabs/startups-admins
dprint.json              @awslabs/startups-admins
.pre-commit-config.yaml  @awslabs/startups-admins
.gitleaks.toml           @awslabs/startups-admins
.semgrep.yaml            @awslabs/startups-admins
.markdownlint-cli2.yaml  @awslabs/startups-admins

